     "finding": "All 122 Ir P-V-T observations from the laser-heating runs printed in Supplementary Tables 1-3 are bundled, including two 300 K baseline rows and retaining the applicable MgO or KCl calibrant, both pyrometry measurements, and their source-required arithmetic mean. Figure 4 supplies vector presentation coordinates for 91 Monteseguro 300 K and 16 present-study 830 K markers; these 107 plot-derived rows are bundled separately with calibration and uncertainty metadata. The original numerical rows and exact fit protocol are not published, so the complete combined regression still cannot be rerun exactly."
